{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"88dfe968124b22760b2021a1ff05966bca10f085ce6d6eeba0253dacf63dd9ff","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["持守真道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["因此，我们必须更加重视所听的道，以免随流漂去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["既然借天使传下来的话确凿无误，凡干犯、违背的人都受到了应有的报应，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们若忽略这么大的救恩，怎能逃避惩罚呢？这救恩首先由主亲口宣讲出来，后来由听见的人向我们证实了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["同时，上帝按自己的旨意，用神迹、奇事、各样的异能和圣灵的恩赐与他们一同做见证。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["救恩的元帅"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝并没有把我们所谈论的未来世界交给天使掌管。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["相反，有人在圣经中做见证说：",{"text":"“人算什么，你竟顾念他？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人算什么，你竟眷顾他？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使他暂时比天使低微一点，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐他荣耀和尊贵作冠冕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派他管理你所造的万物，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使万物降服在他脚下。”","poem":1},{"noteId":7},"既然说了叫万物都降服在人的管理之下，就没有一样例外。不过，我们到现在还没有看到万物都降服在人的管理之下，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["只看见耶稣暂时比天使低微一点，好靠着上帝的恩典为世人亲尝死亡的滋味。祂因为经历死亡的痛苦而得到了尊贵和荣耀作冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["作为万物的归宿和本源的上帝，叫救恩的元帅耶稣经历苦难而得以纯全，以便带领许多的儿女进入荣耀，这样的安排是恰当的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为使人圣洁的耶稣和那些得以圣洁的人都出自同一位父亲，所以耶稣不以称呼他们弟兄姊妹为耻。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祂说：",{"text":"“我要向众弟兄传扬你的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在会众当中歌颂你。”","poem":1},{"noteId":8}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["又说：",{"text":"“我要倚靠祂。”","poem":1},{"noteId":9},"还说：",{"text":"“看啊，我和上帝赐给我的儿女都在这里。”","poem":1},{"noteId":10}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因为众儿女都是血肉之躯，所以祂也同样成为血肉之躯，以便亲身经历死亡，借此摧毁掌握死亡权势的魔鬼，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["释放那些因怕死而一生做奴隶的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["很明显，祂要救助的不是天使，而是亚伯拉罕的后裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["所以祂必须在每一方面都与祂的弟兄姊妹相同，以便在事奉上帝的事上成为一位仁慈忠信的大祭司，替众人献上赎罪祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["祂经历过受试探的痛苦，所以能帮助受试探的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇8:4‑6。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇22:22。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":12}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书8:17。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书8:18。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}